*.exe

# Rigged model assets are never versioned. The anim-rigid demo loads its FBX at
# run time from src/demo/anim-rigid/ (see doc/user/10-demos.md); real mesh data is
# staged through src/assets/models/, which has its own ignore-everything rule.
# This is a whole-tree rule on purpose: it is the difference between "we read the
# FBX" and "we committed the FBX".
*.fbx
